direction: down

Training: 大模型训练 {
  T1: Batch 大，GEMM 大
  T2: Compute Bound
  T3: 优化：Tensor Core\nBF16，Distributed
  
  T1 -> T2
  T2 -> T3
  
  T2.style.stroke: green
  T3.style.stroke: blue
  T3.style.bold: true
}

Serving: 大模型推理 {
  S1: Prefill: Compute Bound\nDecode: Memory Bound
  S2: 瓶颈在 KV Cache\n和 Weight Loading
  S3: 优化：FlashAttention\nKV Cache，Quantization
  
  S1 -> S2
  S2 -> S3
  
  S2.style.stroke: red
  S3.style.stroke: blue
  S3.style.bold: true
}

LowLatency: 低延迟小模型推理 {
  L1: Batch=1，模型小
  L2: Memory / Latency Bound
  L3: 优化：Fusion\nCUDA Graph，SIMD
  
  L1 -> L2
  L2 -> L3
  
  L2.style.stroke: orange
  L3.style.stroke: blue
  L3.style.bold: true
}
